{
  "info": {
    "name": "Company App API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the Company App API. \n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `base_url` variable to your server (default: http://localhost:8080)\n2. Use the **Login** request to get a JWT token — it auto-sets the `token` variable\n3. All other requests use `Bearer {{token}}` automatically\n\n## Important Notes\n- Most entity IDs are client-generated (UUIDs) — you provide them in the request\n- Protected endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header\n- Dates use ISO-8601 format (e.g. `2026-07-14`)\n- Monetary amounts are strings (e.g. `\"1500.00\"`)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "manual"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token set:', json.token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"admin\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
